From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Subject: [PATCH] init: use cgroup v2 service profiles

Initialize the delegated hierarchy before vendor init is forked.
Place services in their process domains before applying profiles or
dropping privileges. Remove unsupported v1 memory controls and use
task profiles instead of v1 writepid paths in service definitions.

Signed-off-by: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
---
 debuggerd/tombstoned/tombstoned.rc |  2 +-
 gatekeeperd/gatekeeperd.rc         |  2 +-
 init/init.cpp                      |  6 +++++-
 init/service.cpp                   | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 init/service.h                     |  3 ---
 init/service_parser.cpp            | 25 ++++++++---------------
 init/service_parser.h              |  2 --
 init/service_utils.cpp             | 27 -------------------------
 llkd/llkd-debuggable.rc            |  2 +-
 llkd/llkd.rc                       |  2 +-
 rootdir/init.zygote32.rc           |  2 +-
 rootdir/init.zygote64.rc           |  2 +-
 storaged/storaged.rc               |  2 +-
 13 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

diff --git a/debuggerd/tombstoned/tombstoned.rc b/debuggerd/tombstoned/tombstoned.rc
